  "summary": "Hofseth BioCare ASA produces and sells health nutritional products for humans and pets in Norway, the United Kingdom, France, Belgium, Italy, Germany, Turkey, rest of Europe, Japan, Asia, and the United States. The company offers ProGo, a bioactive peptide for weight management and metabolic health; OmeGo, a fish oil that provides a full spectrum of fatty acids and omegas; CalGo and NT-II, which are calcium collagen complexes that support joint and bone health; CollaGo; and PetGo, a non-soluble protein. Hofseth BioCare ASA was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Ålesund, Norway.",
